{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Encoding batches","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatch"],"anchor":"Encoding-batches"},{"title":"Records left out","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorEncodingError"],"anchor":"Records-left-out"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a self-hosted TraffluentCollector’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"POST \/v1\/batches","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Give it to an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") as its encoder,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and pass the collector’s API key to the destination as an "},{"code":"Authorization: Bearer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" header field."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The body is JSON: one object per record, with the record’s identifier (which a redelivered record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps), the event’s name, its timestamp, whether it is redelivered, its properties and its context."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Properties are read from the event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"type":"text","text":" form, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" derives, through the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event’s schema in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" the encoder is made with. The context holds the standard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context keys the record has values for, its session and sample rate, and its trace context. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" value is written only while the record reveals it; once redacted, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property is left out, and an array’s element, or a value inside a type the plan can’t map, is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"null"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A record the encoder can’t write is left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one whose event and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version the plan doesn’t describe, one whose event isn’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"type":"text","text":", and one holding a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"JSON can’t, such as a NaN. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns each record left out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkippedRecord"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), which the destination logs and reports on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dropReports"},{"type":"text","text":". When no record of a batch can be written, the destination sends nothing."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns the same body and skipped records without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To send to a server of your own format, write a "},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of your own. To send to PostHog,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"code":"PostHogBatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"code":"PostHogEncoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import CollectorEncoding","import HTTPDestinations","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()","let encoder = CollectorBatchEncoder(plan: plan)","let collector = HTTPDestination(","    endpoint: collectorURL,  \/\/ https:\/\/collector.example.com\/v1\/batches","    headerFields: [.authorization: \"Bearer \\(apiKey)\"],","    encoder: encoder)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: collector)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers sending to the collector beside the other destinations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/collectorencoding"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write batches of records in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, for an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" to send."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"CollectorEncoding","title":"CollectorEncoding","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"CollectorEncoding"}]},"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"title":"Choosing Destinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Choosing Destinations","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","abstract":[{"text":"Send each batch of records to an HTTP endpoint, and send it again until it arrives.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations","kind":"symbol","title":"HTTPDestinations","role":"collection"},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder/batch(of:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CollectorBatch","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17CollectorEncoding0A5BatchV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The body of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch"},{"type":"text","text":" in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, and the records left out of it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder\/batch(of:)","kind":"symbol","title":"batch(of:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://Collect